{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-teller-semantic.md","title":"真理陈述者的三种一致固定点赋值","display":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 真理陈述者的三种一致固定点赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","aliases":["91-df-truth-teller-semantic","91-df-truth-teller-analysis"],"display":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 真理陈述者的三种一致固定点赋值","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-teller-semantic</span><span>91-df-truth-teller-analysis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-teller-semantic — 真理陈述者的三种一致固定点赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=T(t)\">\\(\\tau=T(t)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a> 的标准闭项构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 均采用已校准的强 Kleene 固定点语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)\\coloneqq\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\\land\n\\exists X_t,X_f\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_{X_t}(\\tau)=\\mathbf t\\land v_{X_f}(\\tau)=\\mathbf f].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}teller\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TellSem}_J(\\tau)\\coloneqq\nv_{X_{\\min}}(\\tau)=\\mathbf u\\land\n\\exists X_t,X_f\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_{X_t}(\\tau)=\\mathbf t\\land v_{X_f}(\\tau)=\\mathbf f].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从空信息迭代永不添加该自支撑真理原子及其否定。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>、或以其否定作相容初始支持并闭合，可以得到另外两个一致固定点；书中 §15.1 明确列出这些情况。\n这是模型存在结论的缩写，不把它仅因被写成谓词定义就当成自动证明；证明依据为原书相容闭包构造。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemmata 15.6–15.8、Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemmata 15.12–15.14，印刷页 189–196，PDF 页 200–207。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",